description:
Design a 4-bit up counter that increments its value on the positive edge of the clock signal. The counter resets to zero when the reset signal is asserted or when it reaches the value of 9 (binary 1001). This module serves the purpose of counting in a loop from 0 to 9.
module top_module(
    input clk, rst,
    output reg [3:0] counter_output
);

code:
module top_module(
    input clk, rst,
    output reg [3:0] counter_output
);always@ (posedge clk) begin 
        if( rst | counter_output == 4'b1001)
            counter_output <= 4'b0000;
        else
            counter_output <= counter_output + 1;
    end
endmodule

